{"id":"34a91ec31209cb96","group":"93","path":"93/93-thm-profinite-completion.md","title":"thm-profinite-completion","display":"thm-profinite-completion","type":"theorem","metadata":{"book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","depends_on":["[[93-df-profinite-completion]]","[[93-df-residual]]","[[93-df-homomorphism]]","[[93-df-embedding]]","[[93-lem-congruence-kernel]]"],"display":"thm-profinite-completion","label":"93-thm-profinite-completion","aliases":["93-thm-profinite-completion"],"type":"theorem"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"03a4b56655d6ad49\" href=\"?note=03a4b56655d6ad49\" title=\"93-df-profinite-completion\">93-df-profinite-completion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d5b18fd1da461692\" href=\"?note=d5b18fd1da461692\" title=\"93-df-residual\">93-df-residual</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" href=\"?note=f10e7e3251fa7f7d\" title=\"93-df-homomorphism\">93-df-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d611f4ac8b8895ab\" href=\"?note=d611f4ac8b8895ab\" title=\"93-df-embedding\">93-df-embedding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4f176786881b1435\" href=\"?note=4f176786881b1435\" title=\"93-lem-congruence-kernel\">93-lem-congruence-kernel</a></span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-profinite-completion"},{"key":"label","html":"93-thm-profinite-completion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-thm-profinite-completion</span></div>"},{"key":"type","html":"theorem"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-profinite-completion-thm-profinite-completion\">thm-profinite-completion <code>thm-profinite-completion</code></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> is fixed and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\">\\(I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat{\\mathbf A}_{93,\\tau}\">\\(\\widehat{\\mathbf A}_{93,\\tau}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\eta_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\">\\(\\eta_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\)</span> are the exact finite-quotient inverse-system constructions of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"03a4b56655d6ad49\" href=\"?note=03a4b56655d6ad49\" title=\"93-df-profinite-completion\">93-df-profinite-completion</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{FinAlg}_{\\tau}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{FinAlg}_{\\tau}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Residual}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Residual}_{93}\\)</span> have their source signatures.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(\\eta_{\\mathbf A,\\tau},\\mathbf A,\\widehat{\\mathbf A}_{93,\\tau})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(\\eta_{\\mathbf A,\\tau};\\mathbf A)\n=\\bigcap I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(\\eta_{\\mathbf A,\\tau},\\mathbf A,\\widehat{\\mathbf A}_{93,\\tau})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Residual}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\mathbf A,\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\};\\tau\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}profinite\\text{-}completion}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf A)\\to{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Hom}_{93}(\\eta_{\\mathbf A,\\tau},\\mathbf A,\\widehat{\\mathbf A}_{93,\\tau})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Ker}_{93}(\\eta_{\\mathbf A,\\tau};\\mathbf A)\n=\\bigcap I_{\\mathbf A,\\tau}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Emb}_{93}(\\eta_{\\mathbf A,\\tau},\\mathbf A,\\widehat{\\mathbf A}_{93,\\tau})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Residual}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\mathbf A,\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\};\\tau\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The algebraic completion is the inverse limit by definition. The theorem identifies the kernel of the canonical map and hence its exact residual-finiteness criterion; no topology or density claim is made without a separately defined profinite topology.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-profinite-completion-thm-profinite-completion","text":"thm-profinite-completion `thm-profinite-completion`","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-profinite-completion","status":"resolved","id":"03a4b56655d6ad49","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-profinite-completion]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-residual","status":"resolved","id":"d5b18fd1da461692","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-residual]]","