hbf A}_{93,\\tau})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Residual}_{93}\\bigl(\n\\mathbf A,\\{\\mathbf B:\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land\\mathrm{FinAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\};\\tau\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1712,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["03a4b56655d6ad49","d5b18fd1da461692","f10e7e3251fa7f7d","d611f4ac8b8895ab","4f176786881b1435"]}